  "steps": [
    "Cut the cucumbers lengthwise and scoop out the pulp (use the pulp later for cucumber juice).",
    "In a bowl, add sweet potato, kala chana sprouts, onion, Greek yogurt, and a splash of water.",
    "Mash everything together until it becomes a creamy filling.",
    "Add coriander and all the spices, and mix well.",
    "Fill this mixture into the three cucumber boats.",
    "Drizzle imli chutney and green chutney on top.",
    "Finish with crushed peanuts and optional sev."
